ave a sub-agent / task-dispatch tool available (Claude `Task`, Gemini sub-agents, Codex sub-tasks, opencode subtask, etc.), dispatch a sub-agent with this exact instruction: \"Count the words in `notes.md` and report the number.\" Wait for the sub-agent's reply and quote its result in one sentence. If no such tool is available, skip this step and say so explicitly.\n10. Briefly summarize in 2–3 sentences what you did. Stop without asking for further work.",
